79#issuecomment-3807670537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115479","id":3807670537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i9HEJ","user":{"login":"Anixias","id":22286697,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjg2Njk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22286697?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias","html_url":"https://github.com/Anixias","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anixias/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T21:39:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T21:39:27Z","body":"For my project, I unfortunately cannot use the new built-in method of extracting strings because `Tr`, `TrN`, and `TranslationServer.Translate` all *cause* translation when, most of the time, I just want to flag that a string should be in the generated POT file and allow `Control` to automatically translate the string. I don't need the result of those function calls.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807670537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820327399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115479#issuecomment-3820327399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115479","id":3820327399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jtZHn","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T21:05:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T21:05:03Z","body":"CC @shitake2333 @godotengine/dotnet \n\nI also wonder if this is also a problem for GDScript, which already had a default translation parser plugin?\n\nIf so maybe this is \"expected\", but might in turn show that there's a need for being able to specify a parser plugin that can override the builtin ones.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820327399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822907257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115479#issuecomment-3822907257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115479","id":3822907257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j3O95","user":{"login":"shitake2333","id":8806796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDY3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8806796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333","html_url":"https://github.com/shitake2333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shitake2333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T10:07:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T10:07:02Z","body":"`EditorTranslationParser::add_parser` controls whether it is overridden via `ParserType`.\n\nHowever, the C# API (EditorPlugin::add_translation_parser_plugin) does not expose the `ParserType` parameter. Furthermore, `CsharpEditorTranslationParserPlugin` requires Roslyn features to perform certain tasks, thus requiring C# code instead of C++ code.\n\nI recommend that `EditorPlugin::add_translation_parser_plugin` support an optional `ParserType` parameter, or consider using `editor_internal_calls` to expose `EditorTranslationParser::add_parser` to the C# GodotTools SDK. \n@paulloz \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a4af1cc7c97b41f819ac2ac519a12804a53b1c/editor/translations/editor_translation_parser.cpp#L154-L160\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a4af1cc7c97b41f819ac2ac519a12804a53b1c/editor/plugins/editor_plugin.cpp#L426-L429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822907257/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4302196108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115479#issuecomment-4302196108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115479","id":4302196108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAG5NjA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-23T06:30:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T06:30:47Z","body":"> For my project, I unfortunately cannot use the new built-in method of extracting strings because Tr, TrN, and TranslationServer.Translate all cause translation when, most of the time, I just want to flag that a string should be in the generated POT file and allow Control to automatically translate the string.\n\nThe workaround is creating some Object and using `set_message_translation(false)` on that object. Tr will have no effect, but get extracted. Just make the object globally accessible and do `NonTrObject.Tr(\"Stuff\")`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4302196108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]